OL,3,AAt least 37 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-seven people have been killed
OL,7,Fand almost 400 evacuated after a
OL,8,FRussian drone strike triggered an
OL,9,Fexplosion at a warehouse in the Kyiv
OL,10,Fregion late on Friday.
OL,12,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,13,Fblast damaged residential buildings and
OL,14,Fa care home in the surrounding area,
OL,15,Fwith an investigation launched into
OL,16,Fwhether ammunition was being stored on
OL,17,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
