OL,3,AAt least 37 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour children are among 42 people
OL,7,Finjured, according to regional head
OL,8,FTymur Tkachenko, with search and rescue
OL,9,Foperations ongoing at the site in the
OL,10,FBucha district early on Saturday.
OL,12,FZelensky wrote on X: "The regulations
OL,13,Fare clear: Ammunition must not be
OL,14,Fstored near houses or other residential
OL,15,Fbuildings. Appropriate conclusions will
OL,16,Fcertainly be drawn."
